  "releaseNotes": "1.4.4: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.4. Two new tools: compress_sql (whitespace-safe SQL compression via CavemanSqlCompressor, with optional comment stripping and CCR value-folding) and idf_languages (lists the 56 shipped global-IDF tables and checks table/corpus size per ISO 639-3). route_content now routes SQL content to the SQL compressor (ContentType.Sql). 1.4.3 was a corrective re-publish of 1.4.2.",
